WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.857
It was late at night.

2
00:00:04.857 --> 00:00:10.713
A guard walked through an old army base.

3
00:00:10.713 --> 00:00:13.876
"It's a quiet night," the guard said to himself.

4
00:00:13.876 --> 00:00:21.704
"Maybe I'll take a nap in the office."

5
00:00:21.704 --> 00:00:29.354
The guard went around the corner of a building and gasped.

6
00:00:29.355 --> 00:00:31.496
"Oh no!" he cried.

7
00:00:31.496 --> 00:00:38.484
"One of the army tanks was stolen!"

8
00:00:38.484 --> 00:00:40.996
"This is great!" said Terrell.

9
00:00:40.996 --> 00:00:45.473
"I love being outside on a school day!"

10
00:00:45.473 --> 00:00:48.775
Roxy and her friends were in the school garden.

11
00:00:48.775 --> 00:00:51.418
They were helping Mr. Green.

12
00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:55.079
"Good morning, everybody!" said Mr. Green.

13
00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:58.136
"We're going to have lots of fun today.

14
00:00:58.136 --> 00:01:02.925
Everybody needs gardening gloves and a trowel."

15
00:01:02.925 --> 00:01:06.513
Roxy and her friends got their gardening equipment.

16
00:01:06.513 --> 00:01:10.477
Jack grinned. "I can't wait to get dirty!"

17
00:01:10.478 --> 00:01:15.165
"I have lots of seeds for flowers and vegetables," said Mr. Green.

18
00:01:15.166 --> 00:01:18.256
"Each of you can choose what you want to plant.

19
00:01:18.256 --> 00:01:24.488
With time and care, all the plants will grow!"

20
00:01:24.488 --> 00:01:27.997
Mara picked out some sunflower seeds.

21
00:01:27.997 --> 00:01:31.159
"I love sunflowers," she said.

22
00:01:31.159 --> 00:01:34.664
"They're so big and bright."

23
00:01:34.664 --> 00:01:38.413
"I want fresh vegetables for lunch," said Roxy.

24
00:01:38.413 --> 00:01:43.033
"I'm going to plant carrots and lettuce."

25
00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:44.313
Jack made a face.

26
00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:46.748
"Who cares about vegetables?

27
00:01:46.748 --> 00:01:49.696
I just like digging in the dirt!"

28
00:01:49.696 --> 00:01:52.157
He stuck his trowel into the ground.

29
00:01:52.157 --> 00:01:58.003
He scooped out some soil.

30
00:01:58.003 --> 00:02:02.276
Then he picked up a wiggling, little worm.

31
00:02:02.276 --> 00:02:08.179
"Cool!" Jack held the worm out to his friends.

32
00:02:08.179 --> 00:02:10.310
"Eww," said Terrell.

33
00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.766
"Keep that thing away from me!"

34
00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:16.325
"That's gross, Jack," said Mara.

35
00:02:16.325 --> 00:02:19.059
"Worms are cute," said Roxy.

36
00:02:19.059 --> 00:02:24.849
"Plus, they help the soil to stay healthy."

37
00:02:24.849 --> 00:02:27.370
Mara and Roxy dug in the soil.

38
00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:31.519
"I can't wait until my sunflowers bloom," said Mara.

39
00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:35.879
"You have to plant them first!" Roxy laughed.

40
00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:39.183
"You know what this garden needs?" said Jack.

41
00:02:39.183 --> 00:02:41.028
"A pond!"

42
00:02:41.028 --> 00:02:44.626
"I want a pond with frogs in it," said Mara.

43
00:02:44.626 --> 00:02:47.390
"And maybe some turtles."

44
00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.980
"Maybe Rocket Girl can dig a big pond for us!" said Terrell.

45
00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.022
Roxy rolled her eyes.

46
00:02:54.022 --> 00:02:57.519
"Rocket Girl is pretty busy, Terrell.

47
00:02:57.519 --> 00:03:00.823
She doesn't have time to dig a pond."

48
00:03:00.823 --> 00:03:02.689
Terrell shrugged.

49
00:03:02.689 --> 00:03:08.174
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:03:08.174 --> 00:03:15.131
Roxy stepped away from her friends.

51
00:03:15.131 --> 00:03:19.363
She pressed a button on her watch.

52
00:03:19.363 --> 00:03:21.795
"Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

53
00:03:21.795 --> 00:03:23.767
"What's wrong?"

54
00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:26.879
"Rocket Girl!" said Mayor Bloom.

55
00:03:26.879 --> 00:03:30.851
"Somebody is robbing Metro City Central Bank!"

56
00:03:30.851 --> 00:03:33.800
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

57
00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:39.317
"I'm on my way!"

